          "Materials: Two weights on a plate.",
          "Action: Pushing plates together to simulate subduction zones and pressure buildup."
        ],
        "transform": [
          "Materials: Strips tied loosely.",
          "Action: Pulling in opposite directions to simulate sliding friction."
        ]
      },
      "discussion": [
        "Groups share their observations on pressure changes and movement velocities.",
        "Teacher guides students to connect these physical observations to real-world geological hazards."
      ],
      "assessment_frame": {
