          "Group A: Generate 'P-waves' (sound-like) which travel fast.",
          "Group B: Generate 'S-waves' (silent/slower) which cannot travel through liquid.",
          "Present the data: Explain that S-waves stop at the Outer Core boundary.",
          "Conclusion: The boundary must be a liquid layer."
