      "activity_type": "Role-Play and Calculation Workshop",
      "participant_groups": 4,
      "steps": [
        {
          "step": "Introduction",
          "action": "Lecturer briefly defines CBA and the formula: NPV = PV(Benefits) - PV(Costa)"
        },
        {
          "step": "Data Presentation",
          "action": "Distribute a simplified data sheet regarding a proposed bridge connecting two cities. Includes construction cost, maintenance, traffic savings, and environmental impact."
        },
        {
          "step": "Data Processing",
          "action": "In groups, calculate the Benefit-Cost Ratio (BCR) using a 4% discount rate over a 20-year period."
        },
        {
          "step": "Conclusion",
          "action": "Present findings. One group identifies a missing benefit (e.g., rural farmers,"facilitating"access). The class discusses the difficulty of calculating this 'Shadow Price'."
