        "label": "Secondary Socialization",
        "explanation": "Understanding how adults (employers, sports) socialize themselves or others, often called 're-socialization', is abstract for students."
      },
      {
        "label": "Cultural Bias",
        "explanation": "Recognizing that definitions of agents vary across cultures (e.g., extended family vs. nuclear family)."
      }
