      },
      {
        "difficulty": "British vs. French Interests",
        "explanation": "Understand the difference between the British desire for a distant Grand Alliance and French fear of a German revival, and how this created internment tensions."
      },
      {
        "difficulty": "Self-Determination Paradox",
        "explanation": "Applying the principle of self-determination to small ethnic areas (likeArmor or Danzig) often contradicted practical military needs."
      }
    ],
